ody thought were  possible very odd moment so overall the  speech was filled with Donald Trump's  lies blaming Obama shirking  responsibility false claims of success  but it does seem that Iran's ploy in a  sense worked Iran retaliated they got a  response to the assassination of Kasim  soleimani on the record but they gave  Donald Trump a way out Trump also  believes that he won he got Kasim  Soleimani Iran retaliated but didn't  kill anybody  so is this all good well the X Factor is  that Donald Trump wants all of this to  help him get reelected to distract from  impeachment if nothing else happens the  conversation goes right back to Donald  Trump being an impeached president to  Donald Trump as a vulnerable incumbent  president that's where we are today we  should all be glad that it appears as  though there's not going to be a further  escalation but what I want to talk about  later today and we're going to talk  about next is the fact that Trump backed  away from a problem he created can't be  seen as an administration this is like  taking credit for putting out a fire  that you started I think it was Bernie  Sanders who used that metaphor and  that's what I want to talk about next
 

